	"Set the font my text will use. The emphasis remains unchanged."

	self font: aFont emphasis: emphasis.! !
!LabelMorph methodsFor: 'font' stamp: 'jmv 1/2/2024 14:41:15' prior: 50332200!
                         fontFamily: aFontFamily
	"Set the font my text will use. The emphasis remains unchanged."

