	self assert: classToRemove isObsolete ! !
!SafelyRemoveClassTest methodsFor: 'tests' stamp: 'HAW 8/1/2018 16:43:11'!
                               test03RemovingTheMetaclassRemovesTheClass

	| classToRemove safeRemove | 
	
